 ## Background
-The NeRF-Synthetic dataset was introduced in the original NeRF paper [S1, S2, unofficial]. It consists of synthetic scenes rendered with Blender, providing ground-truth camera poses and images [S1, S2, unofficial]. The dataset loader described here is a common implementation pattern found in various NeRF tutorials and repositories [S1, S2, unofficial].
